WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.408
Today’s lesson goal: Today’s lesson goal: spot risky prompts and outputs, add clear refusal and escalation rules, and keep user data out of places it should not go.

2
00:00:09.758 --> 00:00:19.334
Practical safety habits: Practical safety habits: do not paste secrets into prompts, refuse harmful or disallowed requests, and document what the system must never do.

3
00:00:19.684 --> 00:00:29.620
Worked example: support bot: Worked example: a support bot may summarise tickets from provided text, must not invent refunds or legal advice, and must escalate threats to a human.

4
00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:39.570
Practice checkpoint: Practice checkpoint: write a short safety checklist for your use case, add two refusal test prompts, then continue in the written Module 5 lesson.
